### ECO SUDAR MINIMAL QUERIES & QUOTES TEST SUITE ###
# Note: You must deploy your API changes to Hostinger first!
# Replace {{token}} with a valid logged-in user token to test.

@baseUrl = https://api.ecosudar.com/api
@token = your_jwt_token_here

---

### [QUERIES] Test 1: Positive - Create Query (Guest / No Auth required)
POST {{baseUrl}}/queries
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "John Doe",
    "email": "john@example.com",
    "message": "I would like to know more about biomass pellets pricing for bulk orders."
}
# EXPECTED: 201 Created (query_id, query_number, status: pending)

---

### [QUOTES] Test 2: Positive - Create Quote (Auth Required)
POST {{baseUrl}}/quotes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Jane Smith",
  "email": "jane@company.com",
  "phone": "9876543210",
  "message": "Customer uses 100 kg of LPG at ₹85/kg (₹8,500/month). They need 283 kg/month of Biomass Pellets (≈ ₹3,967/month), saving ₹4,533/month."
}
# EXPECTED: 201 Created (quote_id, quote_number, status: pending)

---

### [ADMIN] Test 3: Positive - Get Admins List
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/quotes
Authorization: Bearer admin_jwt_token_here
# EXPECTED: 200 OK (Returns paginated quotes history)
